   | <p>Commands in this chat:</p>
   | <ul><li><code>new &lt;directory&gt;</code>: start a Codex session in a new work chat</li>
   | <li><code>list</code>: list sessions</li>
   | <li><code>r &lt;session&gt;</code>: wake a parked session (for example <code>r s003</code>)</li>
   | <li><code>park &lt;session&gt;</code>: stop reading a session&#39;s chat until woken</li>
   | <li><code>fork &lt;session&gt;</code>: copy a session into a new work chat</li>
   | <li><code>model</code>: list the models Codex offers</li>
   | <li><code>stats</code>: requests and token usage of all sessions</li>
   | <li><code>skills</code>: list skill subscriptions (<code>skills add &lt;url&gt;</code>, <code>skills sync</code>)</li>
   | <li><code>status</code>: helper status</li>
   | <li><code>restart</code>: restart the helper</li>
   | <li><code>shutdown</code>: stop the helper on all machines until <code>cxp teams start</code> is run on a machine</li>
   | <li><code>update now</code> / <code>update prerelease</code>: update the helper (<code>update status</code> shows a pending update)</li>
   | <li><code>codex update now</code>: update the Codex CLI</li>
   | <li><code>help</code>: this help</li>
   | </ul>
