== cli
$ cxp teams start
   exit 0
   stdout| Started the Teams helper again on all machines (it was: Stopped on all machines by `shutdown` in the Teams control chat (host-a, <time:1>); removed <root>/home/.local/state/codex-helper/teams/DISABLED).
   stdout| No Teams service is installed on this machine. A helper standing by on any machine (the last one ran on host-a) resumes within a minute; if none is, run `cxp teams run`, or install the service with `cxp teams service install`.
